sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API
    Client->>API: GET /devices (X-Auth-Token)
    alt status 200
        API-->>Client: 200 + data
    else status 401
        API-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
    end
    loop until endTime is set
        Client->>API: GET /task/{taskId}
        API-->>Client: 200 status
    end
    opt only if isError is true
        Client->>API: GET /task/{taskId}/logs
        API-->>Client: 200 failureReason
    end
    par site A
        Client->>API: POST /sites/A/provision
    and site B
        Client->>API: POST /sites/B/provision
    end
    API-->>Client: 202 (A)
    API-->>Client: 202 (B)
